meta {
  name: OnboardingStep Create
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding-steps/create
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:json {
  {
    "title_oz": "Ro'yxatdan o'ting",
    "title_ru": "Зарегистрируйтесь",
    "title_uz": "Рўйхатдан ўтинг",
    "title_en": "Sign up",
    "short_content_oz": "Boshlash uchun ariza qoldiring.",
    "short_content_ru": "Оставьте заявку, чтобы начать.",
    "short_content_uz": "Бошлаш учун ариза қолдиринг.",
    "short_content_en": "Submit an application to get started.",
    "sort_order": 0,
    "status": true
  }
}

docs {
  Yangi boshlash bosqichini yaratish. JSON body, admin yoki superadmin tokeni kerak.

  | Maydon | Turi | Cheklov |
  |---|---|---|
  | `title_oz/ru/uz/en` | string | max 255, ixtiyoriy |
  | `short_content_oz/ru/uz/en` | string | text, ixtiyoriy |
  | `sort_order` | int | ixtiyoriy, standart 0 |
  | `status` | bool | ixtiyoriy, standart true; false ham saqlanadi |

  Barcha maydonlar ixtiyoriy. `{}` ham 201 qaytaradi.
  Yaratilgach OnboardingStep List so'rovini yuboring yoki Local environmentdagi
  `onboardingStepId`ni kerakli yozuv IDsi bilan almashtiring.
  Xabarlar `Accept-Language` bo'yicha tarjima qilinadi.
  URL `onboarding-steps`, jadval nomi `onboarding_steps`.
}
